  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "GA Release 1.0.0: Production-ready in-memory Gremlin database with comprehensive TinkerPop protocol support. Features include: built-in Gremlin server compatible with standard Gremlin.Net clients, WebSocket and TCP endpoint support (.NET 8+), comprehensive scenario framework for test data setup, built-in scenarios for Social Network, E-Commerce, Organization, and User Management, fluent API for easy connector creation and configuration, custom scenario support with extensible provider pattern, high-performance graph traversals and aggregations, production debugging capabilities with scenario export from CosmosDB, complete TinkerPop 3.x compatibility, comprehensive documentation and usage examples. Compatible with .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET 8+.",
